    {
      "number": 18,
      "id": "PR_kwDOQZxkd87G8UL3",
      "title": "Add note about not being agent identity",
      "url": "https://github.com/skyfire-xyz/kyapay-ietf-draft/pull/18",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "skyfire-ankit",
      "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Adding a note to the introduction that KYAPay does NOT aim to define agentic identity. Its aim is to carry agentic identity claims, whatever they may be, from caller to callee.",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-27T23:40:55Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T01:43:43Z",
      "baseRepository": "skyfire-xyz/kyapay-ietf-draft",
      "baseRefName": "main",
      "baseRefOid": "3aef75c991a2326f2b78f8305faa3bc70d063ca6",
      "headRepository": "skyfire-xyz/kyapay-ietf-draft",
      "headRefName": "skyfire-ankit-note-not-agent-identity",
      "headRefOid": "13e96a287b9fe381a80d663f56c97d71523b593f",
      "closedAt": "2026-02-28T01:43:43Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-02-28T01:43:43Z",
      "mergedBy": "selfissued",
      "mergeCommit": {
        "oid": "545845a18fd5e8aef71a1543b708ffa06f261551"
      },
      "comments": [],
      "reviews": [
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOQZxkd87mqT5h",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "84db8ec"
          },
          "author": "selfissued",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "state": "COMMENTED",
          "body": "",
          "createdAt": "2026-02-28T01:42:26Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T01:42:27Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 9,
              "body": "```suggestion\nKYAPay does not aim to define agentic identity in its entirety. Rather, it specifies\na standard and extensible JWT profile for a token that can be used to securely share human\nprincipal and agent identity information with websites and APIs. KYAPay tokens\nprovide a strong signal of human presence behind agentic requests that are\notherwise indistinguishable from programmatic and potentially malicious bot requests.\n\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-02-28T01:42:26Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T01:42:27Z"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOQZxkd87mqUXs",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "13e96a2"
          },
          "author": "selfissued",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "state": "APPROVED",
          "body": "",
          "createdAt": "2026-02-28T01:43:16Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T01:43:16Z",
          "comments": []
        }
      ]
