          "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T05:27:38Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 28,
              "body": "Again, throwing mTLS and HTTP Message Signatures under the bus will create enemies.  These are tools, not competitors.",
              "createdAt": "2026-02-28T05:27:38Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-02-28T05:27:38Z"
