      "body": "Specifically:\r\n\r\n- Allow additional claims and values to be defined and used.\r\n- Require that unrecognized claims be ignored.\r\n- Perform versioning with the \"typ\" header parameter value and claims present rather than a version number.\r\n- Use a boolean-valued claim when the value is effectively true or false.\r\n- Use lowercase names in values.\r\n",
